Usage: lcm bench build [options]

Sample ingested sessions and write a local benchmark file

Options:
  --project <path>    Project directory (default: cwd)
  --n <count>         Number of questions to generate (default: "20")
  --out <file>        Benchmark file path (default: project memory directory)
  --generator <mode>  Question generator: llm or mechanical (default:
                      "mechanical")
  --seed <n>          Deterministic sampling seed (default: "42")
  --language <tag>    Language to write LLM questions in (BCP 47, e.g. pt-BR);
                      default: detected from the corpus
  -h, --help          display help for command
